      "content": "hey my little boy (4yo) woke up with a fever and these weird little red/purple spots all over his tummy and legs. i tried pressing a clear glass against them to see if they went away but they didnt, like they just stayed there even with the pressure. is this just like a heat rash or something from a virus? i'm kinda worried but hope it's nothing major.",
